flowchart TD
  Input["Authorized document input"] --> Hash["Fingerprint content and embedding identity"]
  Hash --> Chunk["Chunk with original offsets"]
  Chunk --> Embed["Embed all chunks"]
  Embed --> Lock["Begin transaction and lock document"]
  Lock --> Same{"Same fingerprint?"}
  Same -->|Yes| Noop["Return unchanged revision"]
  Same -->|No| Version{"Expected version matches?"}
  Version -->|No| Conflict["Reject with HTTP 409"]
  Version -->|Yes| Replace["Replace document and chunks"]
  Replace --> Commit["Commit new revision"]
